                methodologyData: `
                    <ol class="methodology-steps">
                        <li>
                            <div class="methodology-step-header">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="24" height="24"><path d="M21.585 5.584L18.413 2.413a2.011 2.011 0 0 0-2.827 0L2.394 15.59a1.99 1.99 0 0 0-.583 1.21L1.24 21.75a1 1 0 0 0 1.01 1.01l4.95-1.173a1.99 1.99 0 0 0 1.21-.583l13.176-13.174a1.99 1.99 0 0 0 0-2.827zM17 4.53l2.47 2.47-2.58 2.58-2.47-2.47zM4.14 20.36l-1 .235.236-1L6.55 16.42l2.03 2.03zm4.24-3.12l-2.03-2.03L15.17 6.4l2.03 2.03z"></path></svg>
                                <h3>Data Cleaning & Transformation in Power Query</h3>
                            </div>
                            <div class="methodology-content">
                                <ul>
                                    <li>To fix parsing errors, I changed date formats in <code>Date of Admission</code> and <code>Discharge Date</code> using the <strong>English (US)</strong> locale.</li>
